      "customData": {
        "docent": {
          "narrative": "The boundary itself. Today a typed option surface and a createProxy that refuses to pretend; next the stdio passthrough with an in-memory ledger, then HTTP and SQLite, then the pipeline stages drawn in the architecture scene.",
